WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:11.940
Somehow [Coach Charles] McClendon always had an ability to come up with wins against teams with better physical specimens.

2
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:17.940
I remember Bo Schembechler [football coach at Miami University] came down here one time and came to spring practice.

3
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:22.600
He looked at the scrawny little guys that we had and asked Coach Mac,

4
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:29.120
he said, [laughing] “You mean you win ball games with those little guys?”

5
00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:33.120
And he said, “Well, they’ll hit you.

6
00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:35.620
I can tell you what, they might be little but they will hit you.” [laughs]
